      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "さて……「夜な夜なイケショタ愛を叫ぶ」\nという悪霊が出る場所は、砂漠のこの辺りですか……。",
      "jp_sha256": "2c653637c14753ef72eb3e4444a9a45ef206f662c2d6cd1868d6329b59ff469f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "자…… ‘밤마다 잘생긴 쇼타 사랑을 외친다’는\n악령이 나오는 곳은 사막의 이 근처인가…….",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "190ac9d14e56c31a79583a13e3893f0af19268d1265df9dc15f9f8e165145c4b:000001_-235516646580612507:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "さて……「夜な夜なイケショタ愛を叫ぶ」\nという悪霊が出る場所は、砂漠のこの辺りですか……。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
